#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Convert structure/trajectory files between j_presto COD and MDAnalysis formats.

The program is intentionally distributed as a single file so that it follows the
layout of other j_presto Python subprograms.  j_presto COD/CODS I/O and the
j_presto atom-specifier parser are implemented here; other formats are handled
through MDAnalysis.
"""

